    "detailed_description": "One Soul is a game of dungeon exploration in the vein of Dungeon Master, but with Souls-like mechanics, aimed at casual players.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Explore dark dungeons.<br></li><li> Wield your sword to attack enemies (single, combo and strong attacks).<br></li><li> Raise your shield to block light attacks, or dodge to avoid heavy attacks.<br></li><li> Loot fallen enemies or find treasure chests to collect keys to open locks, food to restore your health or gold to increase your wealth.<br></li><li> All art, music and other assets are custom made for this game, for a truly unique experience.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "One Soul is a game of dungeon exploration in the vein of Dungeon Master, but with Souls-like mechanics, aimed at casual players.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Explore dark dungeons.<br></li><li> Wield your sword to attack enemies (single, combo and strong attacks).<br></li><li> Raise your shield to block light attacks, or dodge to avoid heavy attacks.<br></li><li> Loot fallen enemies or find treasure chests to collect keys to open locks, food to restore your health or gold to increase your wealth.<br></li><li> All art, music and other assets are custom made for this game, for a truly unique experience.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Explore dark dungeons. Wield your sword to attack enemies. Raise your shield to block attacks. Find keys to unlock doors. What will you discover?",
